  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 507.01 Bonding of the Excavation Tax. Bonding, pursuant to RSA 72-B:5, shall only apply to a bond or other securities necessary to secure payment of taxes imposed by RSA 72-B.\n\nSource. #7381, eff 10-24-00; ss by #7860, eff 3-31-03, EXPIRED: 3-31-11\n\nNew. #9926, eff 5-19-11 (from Rev 508.01); ss by #12834, eff 7-25-19",
